  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Heat the oil in a large deep pan with the finely chopped onion, ginger and garlic and saute for 1-2 minutes until the onion is soft. Add the cauliflower florets and saute for 5 minutes until softened. If the cauliflower starts sticking, add a little water."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the coconut milk and the cumin, coriander, turmeric and salt, stir and taste. Add the roughly chopped spinach and cherry tomatoes and cook for 1-2 minutes until slightly softened."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the garam masala and stir. Add the eggs and the halloumi and cook for 3-5 minutes until the cheese absorbs a little sauce and the eggs are cooked to your liking."
    }
  ]
